-> Modern debugger for Linux x86-64. Written in Rust for Rust programs.
+> Modern debugger for Linux x86-64 and RISC-V (RV64GC). Written in Rust for Rust programs.
+
+The RISC-V backend uses software instruction stepping. Hardware watchpoints and
+async stepping commands that require them are unavailable on Linux RISC-V.
+LR/SC atomic sequences are stepped as a unit to preserve their reservation.
 
